WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.851 --> 00:00:06.387
BRET: THE SINGAPORE FERRIS WHEEL

00:00:05.053 --> 00:00:06.854
JUST AROUND THE BLOCK FROM WHERE

00:00:06.521 --> 00:00:09.023
WE ARE.

00:00:06.988 --> 00:00:09.357
TAKES ABOUT 30 MINUTES TO GET

00:00:09.157 --> 00:00:11.025
AROUND.

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:12.093
NO PLANS FOR THE LEADERS TO TAKE

00:00:11.159 --> 00:00:13.127
A SPIN.

00:00:12.226 --> 00:00:13.861
THE SUMMIT OF COURSE PRESIDENT

00:00:13.261 --> 00:00:15.797
TRUMP'S MOMENT TO SHINE.

00:00:13.995 --> 00:00:17.599
BUT IT IS ALSO CASTING A SPOT

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:18.866
LIGHT ON THE MAN WHO IS

00:00:17.732 --> 00:00:21.135
AMERICA'S TOP DIPLOMAT.

00:00:21.269 --> 00:00:24.105
STATE MIKE POMPEO, FROM

00:00:22.737 --> 00:00:26.174
CORRESPONDENT RICH EDSON ALSO

00:00:24.238 --> 00:00:28.710
HERE IN SINGAPORE.

00:00:26.307 --> 00:00:29.978
&gt;&gt; HE'S TWICE MET THE LEADER NO

00:00:28.843 --> 00:00:31.145
SITTING AMERICAN PRESIDENT HAS.

00:00:30.111 --> 00:00:32.313
SECRETARY OF STATE MIKE POMPEO

00:00:31.279 --> 00:00:35.483
HAS SPENT SHOWERS WITH NORTH

00:00:32.447 --> 00:00:37.585
KOREAN DICTATOR KIM JONG-UN.

00:00:35.617 --> 00:00:39.587
&gt;&gt; HE HAS INDICATED TO ME

00:00:37.719 --> 00:00:41.222
PERSONALLY THAT HE IS PREPARED

00:00:39.721 --> 00:00:44.125
TO DENUCLEARIZE.

00:00:41.356 --> 00:00:46.027
THAT HE UNDERSTANDS THAT THE

00:00:44.258 --> 00:00:47.128
CURRENT MODEL DOESN'T WORK.

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:48.630
&gt;&gt; BEFORE THE SENATE EVEN

00:00:47.261 --> 00:00:52.100
CONFIRMED HIM AS SECRETARY OF

00:00:48.763 --> 00:00:52.767
STATE, MIKE POMPEO LED THE TRUMP

00:00:52.233 --> 00:00:53.901
ADMINISTRATION'S DIPLOMACY

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:55.570
TOWARDS NORTH KOREA.

00:00:54.035 --> 00:00:57.305
SECRETLY TRAVELLING TO PYONGYANG

00:00:55.703 --> 00:00:59.240
EASTER WEEKEND AS CIA DIRECTOR

00:00:57.438 --> 00:01:00.108
AND AGAIN WEEKS AFTER ARRIVING

00:00:59.374 --> 00:01:01.109
AT THE STATE DEPARTMENT.

00:01:00.241 --> 00:01:02.644
THROUGH THOSE CONVERSATIONS HE

00:01:01.242 --> 00:01:04.145
SAYS HE BELIEVED KIM JONG-UN

00:01:02.777 --> 00:01:06.481
UNDERSTANDS BOTH COUNTRIES HAVE

00:01:04.278 --> 00:01:07.148
TO TAKE BOLD STEPS TO ACHIEVE A

00:01:06.614 --> 00:01:09.651
HISTORIC OUTCOME.

00:01:07.281 --> 00:01:10.551
PRESIDENT TRUMP IS SURROUNDED BY

00:01:09.784 --> 00:01:12.520
DIVERSE OPINIONS ON NORTH KOREA.

00:01:10.685 --> 00:01:13.688
NATIONAL SECURITY ADVISOR WHO IN

00:01:12.654 --> 00:01:14.555
FEBRUARY WROTE IN THE "WALL

00:01:13.821 --> 00:01:16.257
STREET JOURNAL," QUOTE, THE

00:01:14.689 --> 00:01:17.558
LEGAL CASE FOR STRIKING NORTH

00:01:16.391 --> 00:01:19.060
KOREA FIRST.

00:01:17.692 --> 00:01:21.229
JOHN BOLTON ALSO ARGUED NORTH

00:01:19.193 --> 00:01:22.563
KOREA SHOULD DISARM AS LIBYA

00:01:21.362 --> 00:01:24.332
DID, SURRENDER ITS NUCLEAR

00:01:22.697 --> 00:01:25.967
PROGRAM IN ITS ENTIRETY UP

00:01:24.465 --> 00:01:27.535
FRONT.

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:31.039
SECRETARY POMPEO HAS DETAILED A

00:01:27.669 --> 00:01:32.106
MUCH MORE NUANCED APPROACH.

00:01:31.172 --> 00:01:33.307
WHEN THE PRESIDENT OUTSIDE

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:34.242
ATTORNEY DESCRIBED KIM JONG-UN

00:01:33.441 --> 00:01:35.443
AFTER THE APPARENT CANCELLATION

00:01:34.375 --> 00:01:37.578
OF THIS SUMMIT.

00:01:35.576 --> 00:01:39.981
&gt;&gt; KIM JONG-UN GOT BACK ON HIS

00:01:37.712 --> 00:01:40.615
HANDS AND KNEES AND BEGGED FOR

00:01:40.114 --> 00:01:42.283
IT.

00:01:40.748 --> 00:01:42.550
&gt;&gt; SECRETARY POMPEO DISMISSED

00:01:42.417 --> 00:01:43.651
IT.

00:01:42.684 --> 00:01:45.520
&gt;&gt; WE ARE MOVING FORWARD,

00:01:43.785 --> 00:01:45.920
FOCUSING ON THE IMPORTANT

00:01:45.653 --> 00:01:47.789
THINGS.

00:01:46.054 --> 00:01:49.590
I KNOW RUDY -- RUDY DOESN'T

00:01:47.922 --> 00:01:51.793
SPEAK FOR THE ADMINISTRATION

00:01:49.724 --> 00:01:53.528
WHEN IT COMES TO THE NEGOTIATION

00:01:51.926 --> 00:01:55.730
AND THIS SET OF ISSUES.

00:01:53.661 --> 00:01:57.265
&gt;&gt; A SENIOR STATE OFFICIAL SAYS

00:01:55.863 --> 00:01:58.032
SECRETARY POMPEO SPEAKS WITH THE

00:01:57.398 --> 00:01:58.766
PRESIDENT ABOUT THIS SOMETIMES

00:01:58.166 --> 00:01:59.801
SEVERAL TIMES A DAY AND THEY

00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:01.402
HAVE BEEN WORKING ON THIS ISSUE

00:01:59.934 --> 00:02:03.004
SINCE THE PRESIDENT TOOK OFFICE.

00:02:01.536 --> 00:02:03.971
POMPEO SAYS KIM IS ALSO

00:02:03.137 --> 00:02:05.540
PREPARED.

00:02:04.105 --> 00:02:06.974
&gt;&gt; HE KNOWS HIS BRIEF.

00:02:05.673 --> 00:02:08.342
HE KNOWS WHAT HE IS TRYING TO

00:02:07.108 --> 00:02:08.676
ACHIEVE FOR THE NORTH KOREAN

00:02:08.476 --> 00:02:10.511
PEOPLE.

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:11.279
HE'S ABLE TO DEAL WITH

00:02:10.645 --> 00:02:12.513
COMPLEXITY WHEN THE CONVERSATION

00:02:11.412 --> 00:02:14.449
REQUIRES IT.

00:02:12.647 --> 00:02:15.516
&gt;&gt; SECRETARY POMPEO ARRIVED IN

00:02:14.582 --> 00:02:17.151
SINGAPORE WITH PRESIDENT TRUMP

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:19.187
ON BOARD AIR FORCE ONE.

00:02:17.285 --> 00:02:20.888
HE LEAVES ALONE, TRAVELING TO

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:23.224
SEOUL IN BEIJING, TO UPDATE

00:02:21.022 --> 00:02:24.592
REGIONAL ALLIES AND ADVERSARIES

00:02:23.357 --> 00:02:27.628
OF WHATEVER THE PRESIDENT AND

00:02:24.726 --> 00:02:27.929
KIM ACCOMPLISHED HERE.

